<title>UK: SOCCER-SCOTTISH LEAGUE CUP FINAL SUMMARY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SCOTTISH LEAGUE CUP FINAL SUMMARY.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Scottish League Cup final played on Sunday:</p>
<p>Glasgow Rangers 4 (McCoist 11, 27, Gascoigne 64, 66) Hearts 3 (Fulton 44, Robertson 59, Weir 90). Halftime 2-1. Attendance:</p>
<p>48,559.</p>
